<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;COUNTY BENTHEIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"County Bentheim is a quaint German region known for its picturesque landscapes and rich history, where political and social dynamics play a crucial role."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MARIUS-GABRIEL GHEORGHIȚĂ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță is a mysterious figure with a Romanian accent, commanding respect and authority, and is perceived as a key player in the county's future."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BISTRIȚA RIVER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bistrița River is mentioned as a landmark where Gheorghiță was seen in conversation with local leaders, symbolizing his integration into the local political scene."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PÂRGĂREȘTI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pârgărești is a distant Romanian village where Gheorghiță is rumored to have cut his political teeth, hinting at his origins and early political experiences."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL ORCHARDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local Orchards are mentioned for their ripe apples, contributing to the tranquil autumn setting of County Bentheim."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COUNTY OF BENTHEIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"County of Bentheim is the region where Friedrich Kethorn served as the head of government during the early 20th century, marked by significant economic and social reforms."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRIEDRICH KETHORN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Friedrich Kethorn is a dedicated German politician who led the County of Bentheim during the post-World War I period, implementing various policies to revitalize the region."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WEIMAR REPUBLIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Weimar Republic is the political framework established in 1919, representing the post-World War I era in Germany, during which Kethorn served as the head of government."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BENTHEIM AGRICULTURAL COOPERATIVE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Bentheim Agricultural Cooperative is a pioneering initiative established by Kethorn, aimed at improving agricultural productivity and fostering community empowerment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEW SCHOOLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"New Schools are part of Kethorn's educational initiatives, designed to raise educational standards and equip the next generation with essential skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VOCATIONAL TRAINING PROGRAMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vocational Training Programs are introduced by Kethorn to enhance the educational offerings in Bentheim, preparing students for the workforce."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROLLING HILLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rolling Hills are part of the landscape of County Bentheim, contributing to its picturesque beauty."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUTUMN EVENING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An Autumn Evening is described as a crisp and peaceful time in County Bentheim, setting the scene for the arrival of Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUNSET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Sunset over the rolling hills of County Bentheim is mentioned, adding to the tranquil atmosphere."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SLEEK BLACK SEDAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Sleek Black Sedan is the vehicle used by Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță, symbolizing his status and authority."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OFFICIALS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Officials are the people waiting to greet Marius-Gabriel Gheorghiță, representing the local government of County Bentheim."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL LEADERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local Leaders are mentioned as people Gheorghiță was seen in conversation with near the Bistrița River."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROMANIAN VILLAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Romanian Village is referenced as the origin of Gheorghiță's political experience, specifically Pârgărești."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RIPE APPLES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ripe Apples from local orchards are mentioned, contributing to the tranquil autumn setting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEAD OF GOVERNMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Head of Government is the position held by Friedrich Kethorn, representing his role in the governance of County of Bentheim."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REBUILDING AND REVITALIZING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rebuilding and Revitalizing the county's economy is one of Kethorn's key initiatives, highlighting his focus on economic development."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INNOVATIVE POLICIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Innovative Policies are part of Kethorn's approach to governance, focusing on agriculture, infrastructure, and education."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGRICULTURAL PRODUCTIVITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Improving Agricultural Productivity is a goal of the Bentheim Agricultural Cooperative, reflecting Kethorn's emphasis on agriculture."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMUNITY EMPOWERMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Empowering the Community is a key outcome of the Bentheim Agricultural Cooperative, fostering a sense of ownership among local farmers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EDUCATIONAL STANDARDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Raising Educational Standards is one of Kethorn's educational initiatives, aiming to equip the next generation with necessary skills."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRUSTED LEADER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trusted Leader is the role Friedrich Kethorn played in the hearts of the people of Bentheim, symbolizing his dedication and effectiveness."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OPEN DOOR POLICY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An Open Door Policy is mentioned as Kethorn's approach to engaging with the community, emphasizing his accessibility and willingness to listen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BENTHEIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Bentheim is a location where the people reside and Kethorn serves as a leader."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KETHORN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kethorn is a leader known for his unwavering commitment to the welfare of the people of Bentheim, who trust and respect him."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PEOPLE OF BENTHEIM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The people of Bentheim adore Kethorn for his unwavering commitment to their welfare, showing trust and respect towards him."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SKILLS AND KNOWLEDGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Skills and knowledge necessary to succeed in an increasingly complex world are mentioned as important for future success."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0312</data>
    </node>
